              <p class="text-navy-600/70 leading-relaxed mb-2">We'll estimate how many new movers you can expect each month in your target area and send you:</p>
              <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-navy-600/70 space-y-1">
                <li>Estimated monthly volume</li>
